  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation is to find out how the Sida-financed projects have been formulated, carried out, reported and received by the counterparts. The evaluation shall focus on the performance of FOJO as well as on the results of the projects.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xC4;ndam&#xE5;let med utv&#xE4;rderingen &#xE4;r att ta reda p&#xE5; hur de Sida-finansieradeprojekten formulerats, genomf&#xF6;rts och mottagits av motparterna. Utv&#xE4;rderingen skall fokusera dels p&#xE5; FOJOs prestationer, dels p&#xE5; resultaten av projekten.</narrative>
  </description>
